gametitle=Grand Theft Auto: Vice City (NTSC-U Day 1 SLUS-20552 / CRC 20B19E49)
comment=Work in progress. Adds a right-stick Orbit camera and an on-foot first-person camera.
comment=To change camera mode, hold Select and press the current Look Backward control.
comment=With the Zeroable modern-controls patch enabled, Look Backward is always R3, so use Select + R3 on foot and in vehicles.
comment=With stock controls, Look Backward is R3 on foot and L1 + R1 in vehicles.
comment=Select by itself cycles the Orbit camera distance.
comment=On foot, the camera modes are Normal / Orbit / First Person. In vehicles, the camera modes are Normal / Orbit.
comment=Requires a full restart and memory-card load.
[Right Stick Camera and First Person - WIP]
description=Use Select + Look Backward to cycle camera modes. With the modern-controls patch, Look Backward is always R3. Select alone cycles Orbit distance. On foot: Normal/Orbit/First Person. Vehicles: Normal/Orbit. Requires a full restart and memory-card load.
author=Zeroable
